{"id": "De4MheHSCC0", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Happy Birthday @paradox.here 🎂 WAQT by Paradox, as a watercolour love story: aaj aapke WAQT ko humne thoda thehra ke rangon mein utaara hai 🌧️\n\nGali ke aar-paar do khidkiyan, torch ki roshni se hoti baatein, aur ek vaada jo kabhi bola hi nahi gaya. Kaagaz ke panchhi, thandi chai, aur har boond mein ek yaad… par woh phir bhi mil nahi paata.\nIs gaane ne woh sab keh diya jo hum kabhi keh nahi paaye. Thank you, aur janamdin bahut bahut mubarak ✨\n\n🎵 WAQT · @paradox.here \n\nUs insaan ko bhejo jiske liye aaj bhi raaton mein raste naapte ho 💌\n\nParadox WAQT song | WAQT Paradox animation | Hindi rap love song | sad Hindi song | one sided love | adhoori mohabbat | rainy night love story | watercolour animation | animated music video | Paradox birthday\n\n#HappyBirthdayParadox #WAQT #Paradox #HindiRap #WatercolourAnimation", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792847092, "like_count": 2284, "comment_count": 24, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1642317560721231a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.665, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM7mKi_lT-pzABrWO6qjIT06tNwunRC8KeFjHUHV_6ay8fk-CKfRgHiKWqH6dIh7PK7IGdu2mbwjOFWS9-fviRN2iKxVJp-7ZNBUTw.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adp2hVNNnPfRyXE-uhZ1zYyrL7i-_MPXP8-a_-hUsOYoI1eRoQl4GiKDoKinMPz1liykzFk2EbSGu8Z37aXJ3FCg&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=4OCkyzHOQnkQ7kNvwG3cKfl&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=qzvgtTv7awZjGP0ao6J